# Origin of the server whose API (`/api`) the viewer calls. Unset when the server serves the viewer
# itself, and in local dev (the vite proxy in vite.config.ts forwards /api). Set it only when the
# viewer is hosted apart from the server.
# For `npm run build:pages` only (built into dist-pages/): a plain `npm run build` refuses it, since
# dist/ is what the server serves.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
